// ToInbox — Product demo (Reddit-ready)
// Calm pacing. Scenes fill the full screen (canvas scaled to stage width).
//   1. LinkedIn → open panel → Send Application → Enrolled   (Step 2, unchanged)
//   2. Dashboard → single ATS-style table, 3 apps, top row Processing → Sent
//   3. Click the row → dedicated Application Details page (recipients, email, resume)
//   4. Recruiter reply animates into the conversation (interview request) + toast
//   5. "View in Gmail" → full zoomed-out Gmail UI; open the thread in place
